        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose max-w-none theme-text-primary">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Don't miss the exciting game between <strong>{translateSportsData(displayHome)} and {translateSportsData(displayAway)}</strong>. Using our advanced <strong>Methstreams</strong> technology, we provide fast and reliable <strong>Buffstreams</strong> so you can enjoy every moment of this <strong>{translateSportsData(league)}</strong> match in high definition. We offer the best <strong>Rojadirecta</strong> alternatives with optimized servers for a buffer-free experience.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">
          Get ready for kickoff with our verified HD streaming mirrors. As sports fans around the world search for the best ways to watch, our site serves as the ultimate directory, offering multiple <strong>Methstreams</strong> and backup <strong>Buffstreams</strong> links to ensure you never miss a play.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-[#f3a833] border-b border-[var(--border-color)] pb-3 mb-6">
